Subject: [PATCH] Export CSV now follows the Contacts filters

The export ignored the search, follow-up and seat filters and always
downloaded everyone. It now applies the same filters as the list, so
"Seat: Reserved" exports only people who reserved a seat. The filter
logic moves to src/lib/registrationFilters.ts and is shared by the
list and export routes. The file name says what it contains.

